Third-party software in this image
==================================

This image is built on Google's Cloud Marketplace deployer image
(gcr.io/cloud-marketplace-tools/k8s/deployer_helm), which is based on
Ubuntu 22.04. The licences of the Ubuntu packages are in /usr/share/doc.

The following tools are added to the image or come with the base image
without their licence text:

- Helm (https://github.com/helm/helm)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Full text: /usr/share/doc/spacelift-mp/Apache-2.0.txt

- kubectl (https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Full text: /usr/share/doc/spacelift-mp/Apache-2.0.txt

- Google Cloud Marketplace tools (https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/marketplace-k8s-app-tools)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Full text: /usr/share/doc/spacelift-mp/Apache-2.0.txt
